hrows off $18M in free cash flow, which is the owner-earnings figure that actually belongs to shareholders. Cash conversion is thin at 0.17\u00d7, however, which raises the oldest question in analysis: are these earnings backed by cash?.","On the balance sheet, the balance sheet carries net cash, which is the gold standard: the business never has to make desperate decisions in a bad year, and thin 0.4\u00d7 interest coverage leaves no room for a bad year.","Net dilution runs at 5.3% annually, transferring value from owners to stock-based comp, and insiders hold 3.0% of the shares."],"sector_headwinds":[{"text":"Piotroski score 3/9 \u2014 the fundamentals are deteriorating on multiple fronts","sev":"red","cat":"quality"},{"text":"Altman Z in the distress zone (0.2) \u2014 the kind of balance-sheet risk that can make a loss permanent","sev":"red","cat":"quality"},{"text":"Very elevated short interest (29.9% of float) \u2014 sophisticated money is betting against the business","sev":"red","cat":"sentiment"},{"text":"Low reinvestment-driven growth suggests the compounding engine has stalled","sev":"amber","cat":"growth"},{"text":"Insiders are overwhelmingly selling (100% sell ratio) \u2014 the people who know the business want less of it","sev":"amber","cat":"insider","ratio":0.0},{"text":"Financial quality metrics lag Financial Services peers","sev":"amber","cat":"quality"},{"text":"Credit cycles and regulatory capital \u2014 losses accumulate invisibly in good years and appear all at once, and the time to worry is when underwriting standards are loosest.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"},{"text":"Fintech disintermediation \u2014 neobanks, embedded finance, and blockchain rails are unbundling the fee streams that traditional banks took for granted.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"},{"text":"Interest rate regime shifts \u2014 a rapid move in rates can invert the yield curve, crush bond portfolios, and trigger deposit flight simultaneously.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"}],"sector_tailwinds":["Trading at a 32% margin of safety to estimated fair value \u2014 a real cushion against errors in the estimate","Market is pricing in lower growth than the company has historically delivered","Founder-led \u2014 owner alignment that often matters more than any incentive plan","Minimal goodwill on the balance sheet \u2014 low impairment risk"],"news_headlines":[{"title":"Discipline and Rules-Based Execution in VEL Response","source":"news.stocktradersdaily.com","link":"https://news.stocktradersdaily.com/news_release/43/Discipline_and_Rules-Based_Execution_in_VEL_Response_112426022801_1795505281.html","date":"2026-11-24","timestamp":1795505281.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.296,"tier":0,"scope":"company","tags":[]},{"title":"Precision Trading with Velocity Financial Inc - Ordinary Shares (VEL) Risk Zones","source":"news.stocktradersdaily.com","link":"https://news.stocktradersdaily.com/news_release/22/Precision_Trading_with_Velocity_Financial_Inc_-_Ordinary_Shares_VEL_Risk_Zones_111426041002_1794647402.html","date":"2026-11-14","timestamp":1794647402.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.34,"tier":0,"scope":"company","tags":[]},{"title":"Does Velocity Financial (NYSE:VEL) Deserve A Spot On Your Watchlist?","source":"simplywall.st","link":"https://simplywall.st/stocks/us/diversified-financials/nyse-vel/velocity-financial/news/does-velocity-financial-nysevel-deserve-a-spot-on-your-watch-1","date":"2026-11-06","timestamp":1793962219.572,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.888,"tier":0,"scope":"company","tags":[]},{"title":"Velocity Financial (VEL) Q3 2026 Earnings Call Transcript","source":"aol.com","link":"https://www.aol.com/articles/velocity-financial-vel-q3-2026-200142000.html","date":"2026-11-05","timestamp":1793909540.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.0,"tier":0,"scope":"company","tags":["earnings"]},{"title":"(VEL) and the Role of Price-Sensitive Allocations","source":"news.stocktradersdaily.com","link":"https://news.stocktradersdaily.com